	(title_block
		(title "GDRV-HB half-bridge gate driver - Cover / Hierarchy")
		(date "2026-10-04")
		(rev "J0")
		(comment 1 "Barrier: NSI6651ASC + UCC14241-Q1 reinforced (VIOWM 2121 / 1414 VDC) vs 1000 V bus")
		(comment 2 "Schematics authored by Chinmoy Bhuyan")
		(comment 3 "Sheet 1")
		(comment 4 "Not bench-validated. PELV = logic side; HS, LS = floating channels; DCP = DC+ sense.")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "NSI6651ASC + UCC14241-Q1 +15/-4 V, DESAT (3 x US1M), interlock with PWM_L,\ngate/Kelvin pins to the module"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 118.5 54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1037a0ba-fec7-5fbe-ad02-835005bde931")
	)
	(text "Hardware dead time 105-385 ns at the gates = max(firmware, hardware); firmware >= 315 ns is never stretched. Module NTC: plain analog line on the power board (no AIN). Barrier: NSI6651ASC VIOWM 2121 VDC (certified), UCC14241-Q1 1414 VDC (certification planned); CMTI >= 150 V/ns."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 240 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1cd3d3e5-a373-5378-956e-016fe8d76e00")
	)
	(text "Rev J0  |  2026-10-04  |  Schematics authored by Chinmoy Bhuyan  |  Two NSI6651ASC channels for one leg of a CBB011M12GM4T module (DAB-D60)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "21f0db96-6f7f-5c87-9232-de8c3b7bdb42")
	)
	(text "Layout (not in this repo): card over the module signal pins, driver within 25 mm of J201/J301, gate loop < 100 mm (roadmap GDRV); D_H/D_L pins and DESAT strings need 1000 V + overshoot creepage per the ECO-10 insulation coordination."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5b21e6de-4b07-5605-a7fe-853cf3e02314")
	)
	(text "DESAT trips at V_DS 5.4-8.3 V after 263-810 ns blanking; worst-case gate-off 0.71 us (module) / 0.75 us (3 discretes) vs tSC 3 us of IMZA120R020M1H. Wolfspeed CBB011M12GM4T / C3M datasheets give no tSC: unverified."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 236 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7d9eb531-e6d8-531e-8dff-4259518ac0f3")
	)
