	(text "CALCULATED by gen/gdrv.py design_check(), not measured (full list in outputs/GDRV-HB_design_check.txt). Gate rails +14.78..15.45 / -3.95..-4.07 V. Bias 1.02 W of 2.0 W for the module at 100 kHz; worst case 3 x C3M0016120K 1.53 W. Peak gate current 4.1 / 7.2 A (10 A rating)."
